        "original_id": "cb464578-295f-53af-90e3-8a8022d446ed",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: McFarland, USA; The Black Hole; Juntos (Together); Dick Tracy\n- People: Niki Caro; Mark Ciardi; Gordon Gray; Christopher Cleveland; Bettina Gilois; Grant Thompson; Antônio Pinto; Gary Nelson; Peter Ellenshaw\n- Organizations: Walt Disney Productions; Walt Disney Records; Universal Music Latin\n- Topics: film production; soundtrack releases; retirement\n\nFacts:\n- The Black Hole is a 1979 American science fiction film directed by Gary Nelson and produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Peter Ellenshaw retired after his work on The Black Hole in 1979.\n- Peter Ellenshaw contributed matte paintings for Dick Tracy in 1990.\n- McFarland, USA, also known as McFarland, is a 2015 American sports drama film directed by Niki Caro.\n- McFarland, USA was produced by Mark Ciardi and Gordon Gray, written by Christopher Cleveland, Bettina Gilois, and Grant Thompson, and scored by Antônio Pinto.\n- Juntos (Together) was released digitally through the iTunes Store by Walt Disney Records and Universal Music Latin on January 20, 2015.\n- Juntos (Together) was the lead single from the soundtrack for McFarland, USA.",
